IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-part2-arts-8-to-19`

-- Tests of uro-part2-arts-8-to-19. Every expected figure is read by hand from the line of the text cited beside it
-- (uksi-2026-148.txt), as "for X substitute Y": X is the sum before the Order and Y the sum after. None is copied from
-- the encoding's own output.

GIVEN old IS A NUMBER
      new IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` old new MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF old, new

§ `Article 8 -- statutory sick pay (src:126)`

#ASSERT `art 8: section 157(1) of the Contributions and Benefits Act, the weekly rate of statutory sick pay` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 118.75 123.25

