#ASSERT `art 13: regulation 3A of the Social Security (Maximum Additional Pension) Regulations 2010, the prescribed maximum additional pension for survivors who become entitled on or after 6th April 2016` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 222.10 230.54

