§ `Article 16 -- age addition, incapacity benefit (src:162-164)`

#ASSERT `art 16(1): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(a)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 28.90 30.00
#ASSERT `art 16(1): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(b)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 14.45 15.00
-- (2): a claimant entitled to long-term incapacity benefit who was subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations: 15.50 and 8.60
#ASSERT `art 16(2): the sum in regulation 10(2) for a claimant subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(a)` EQUALS 15.50
#ASSERT `art 16(2): the sum in regulation 10(2) for a claimant subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(b)` EQUALS 8.60
-- (1) is "subject to paragraph (2)": a claimant outside (2) gets (1)'s sum, a claimant inside gets (2)'s
#ASSERT `art 16: the sum in regulation 10(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(a)` FALSE EQUALS 30.00
#ASSERT `art 16: the sum in regulation 10(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(b)` FALSE EQUALS 15.00
#ASSERT `art 16: the sum in regulation 10(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(a)` TRUE EQUALS 15.50
#ASSERT `art 16: the sum in regulation 10(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit regulation 10(2)(b)` TRUE EQUALS 8.60

