#ASSERT `art 17(1): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(b)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 18.50 19.20
#ASSERT `art 17(1): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(c)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the arts 8-19 tests` 9.25 9.60
-- (2): 15.50, 8.60 and 8.60 "respectively"
#ASSERT `art 17(2): the sum in regulation 18(2) for a claimant subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(a)` EQUALS 15.50
#ASSERT `art 17(2): the sum in regulation 18(2) for a claimant subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(b)` EQUALS 8.60
#ASSERT `art 17(2): the sum in regulation 18(2) for a claimant subject to regulation 2(3) of the 2008 Regulations` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(c)` EQUALS 8.60
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(a)` FALSE EQUALS 30.00
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(b)` FALSE EQUALS 19.20
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(c)` FALSE EQUALS 9.60
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(a)` TRUE EQUALS 15.50
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(b)` TRUE EQUALS 8.60
#ASSERT `art 17: the sum in regulation 18(2) after the Order` `Incapacity Benefit (Transitional) regulation 18(2)(c)` TRUE EQUALS 8.60

